harhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_005" custom="readingOrder {index:5;}"><Coords points="214,367 974,367 974,407 214,407" /><Baseline points="974,397 594,397 214,397" /><TextEquiv><Unicode>وَالأَظْهَرُ أَنَّهُ إِذَا أَخْرَجَ عَنِ الشَّاةِ أَقَلَّ مَا يَجِبُ فِي الإِبِلِ وَهُوَ بِنْتُ مَخَاضٍ أَجْزَأَهُ</Unicode></TextEquiv></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_Sanhuri_SharhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_006" custom="readingOrder {index:6;}"><Coords points="214,414 974,414 974,450 214,450" /><Baseline points="974,441 594,441 214,441" /><TextEquiv><Unicode>قَالَ القُرْطُبِيُّ فِي شَرْحِ مُسْلِمٍ: البَعِيرُ مِنَ الإِبِلِ بِمَنْزِلَةِ الإِنْسَانِ يَصْدُقُ عَلَى الذَّكَرِ وَالأُنْثَى [انْتَهَى]</Unicode></TextEquiv></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_Sanhuri_SharhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_007" custom="readingOrder {index:7;}"><Coords points="214,461 974,461 974,496 214,496" /><Baseline points="974,488 594,488 214,488" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_Sanhuri_SharhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_008" custom="readingOrder {index:8;}"><Coords points="214,506 974,506 974,542 214,542" /><Baseline points="974,533 594,533 214,533" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_Sanhuri_SharhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_009" custom="readingOrder {index:9;}"><Coords points="214,551 974,551 974,589 214,589" /><Baseline points="974,580 594,580 214,580" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_Sanhuri_SharhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_010" custom="readingOrder {index:10;}"><Coords points="214,598 974,598 974,636 214,636" /><Baseline points="974,627 594,627 214,627" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_Sanhuri_SharhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_011" custom="readingOrder {index:11;}"><Coords points="214,642 974,642 974,682 214,682" /><Baseline points="974,672 594,672 214,672" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_Sanhuri_SharhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_012" custom="readingOrder {index:12;}"><Coords points="214,689 974,689 974,724 214,724" /><Baseline points="974,716 594,716 214,716" /></TextLine><TextLine id="MS_Sanhuri_SharhMukhtasarKhalil_matn_line_013" custom="readingOrde